+        "distinguished plane; without that invariant, one scans the p^3 "
+        "planes not containing the cone vertex and tests sextic squares."
+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Algorithm 3.1 of Celik--Kulkarni--Ren--Sayyary Namin "
+        "finds tritangents by exact elimination; the finite-field reference "
+        "specialization here exhausts p^3 planes and performs O(p^3) "
+        "constant-degree field operations, with the measured shipping cost "
+        "recorded by selftest, whereas the vertex-polar invariant recovers "
+        "the witness in at most 238 exact field operations once recognized."
