+| gate | result | measured evidence |
+|---|---|---|
+| G1 | pass | 12/12 planted certificates verified and JSON-round-tripped |
+| G2 | pass | drop, swap, duplicate, empty, and range errors rejected with 5 distinct reasons |
+| G3 | pass | tagged JSON recovered from prose; garbage returned `None` |
+| G4 | pass | 0/200,000 hits; exact density `4 / 90,438,231,048 = 4.4229e-11` |
