- [Hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1805.11702/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [Placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1805.11702/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The result is not yet shippable: OpenRouter returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” on every redraw, so STEP 4 and G9’s oracle gate remain unresolved. The transcripts record these errors honestly; no hardness verdict was fabricated.
