codex
The slow part is the required 200,000-sample density measurement: it is exercising the full exact sextic-square checker for every random plane, rather than using a cardinality shortcut. The run is still healthy; the separate reference solver is much faster than that audit because it exploits tangent incidences.
diff --git a/gen_1805_11702.py b/gen_1805_11702.py
