-        "constant-degree field operations, with the measured shipping cost "
-        "recorded by selftest, whereas the vertex-polar invariant recovers "
-        "the witness in at most 238 exact field operations once recognized."
+        "Track B: Algorithm 3.1 of the paper finds tritangents by resultants and "
+        "the 45 quartic equations for square binary sextics; the executable "
+        "finite-field tangent-pencil specialization used here is O(p^2), and "
+        "at the hard preset performs up to 3,714,246 measured exact field operations, "
