codex
A final structure-aware audit caught one subtle overcount before handoff: the statement tells the solver to exclude planes through the cone vertex, but the random prior still included them. I’m correcting the candidate sampler and space from all projective planes to exactly the \(p^3\) non-vertex planes. The bound remains below \(10^{-6}\), but this removes the optimistic slack and aligns G4 exactly with the stated language.
apply patch
