With the notation of Definition-Lemma \ref{def:lem14setup}, the planes through $3$ nodes of the Cayley cubic are exactly the $a \in |\kappa_C|$ such that the subvariety
\[
\{ x \in |\kappa_C| : v \cdot s(a,x) = 0  \text{ for all } v \in (V_C/V_{C,\alpha})^* \}
