The algebraic audit found one real issue in the existing work: its duplicate key was not invariant under reparametrizing the supplied weighted source, even though that leaves the geometric problem unchanged. I replaced it with exact binary-dodecic invariants (and exact PGL(2) orbit canonicalization for the tiny demo field), then verified ambient coordinate changes, source changes, equation rescaling, term reordering, and their compositions. I also made the bounded answer language exactly match the structure-aware sampler.
