 ## Caveats
 
-- The mandatory multi-vendor hardness claim is absent until the credential limit is
-  fixed; local attacks and cardinality are not substitutes.
-- This is a deliberately special smooth family. It tests discovery of the
-  vertex-polar invariant, not generic tritangent computation.
