+This generator is based on Celik, Kulkarni, Ren, and Sayyary Namin,
+[“Tritangents and Their Space Sextics”](https://arxiv.org/abs/1805.11702).
+It hands the solver a singular quadric `Q`, a cubic `F`, and an exact
